      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Team Report",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "teamreport-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 As a team, write one short debrief of the term. Be honest about ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "what went well and what didn't",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", look back at your validation and success metrics, and say what you'd do next. One report per team — your individual case studies come after.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "teamreport-template",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "markdown"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "# Final Project Report\n\n## Summary/Debrief\n*what went well and what didn't*\n\n## Validation\n*take a look back on your proposed validation, how did validation go? \ntalk about any success metrics achieved and the challenges of those not achieved*\n\n## Potential Next Steps\n*if you were to continue what would be next?*\n\n## Final Takeaways\n*talk about any lessons learned, what could have been done differently, \nhopes for the future, what you really enjoyed*\n\n## Trailer\nlink to video trailer",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
