        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your Case Study",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 Now each of you writes your own case study — ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "yes, individually, one per person.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " On a team project, \"we\" quietly erases your individual stories. Your case study is where you claim your work and make it legible to someone who wasn't in the room.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-synthesis",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "emoji": "💡"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The good part: this isn't new work. ",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You already did the hard stuff this year — the case study just pulls it into one honest story.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-template-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Use this as your skeleton — and adapt it to your role:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b1",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The problem",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — who was hurting, and why it mattered. The need you found.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b2",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What you built",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — the product in a sentence or two. Drop in the trailer and a screen or two.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b3",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your role",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — what you personally owned. Be specific: features, systems, designs, decisions.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b4",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Process and pivots",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — how you got from idea to product. The hard call, what changed, and why.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-journey",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Show the journey",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — the napkin sketch, the ugly first prototype, the early screenshots you're a little embarrassed by, the before-and-afters. Watching it go from cringe to clean is half the fun.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b5",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The hardest thing you solved",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — one problem you're proud of. Show the messy middle: a diagram, a PR, a before/after.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b6",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did it work?",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — the evidence. The metrics you hit, and the ones you missed.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b7",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What you'd do differently",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — the honest part. A mistake that taught you something.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-b8",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What you took away",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — the skill or insight you're carrying forward.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yourcs-publish",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Publish it where it'll actually be seen. A LinkedIn post or article lands it in front of recruiters; a Medium write-up, your own portfolio site, a Notion page, or just a clean PDF you upload. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "56c3d239-c08e-43f4-8362-7fc66bb82e3f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Then drop the link in your ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Individual Case Study",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " issue.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-voice",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "emoji": "✍️"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You're welcome to use AI to help you write this, as always — just keep it your story, in your voice. ",
