    {
      "id": "h2-story",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "blue",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make It a Story",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "story-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Those beats are the skeleton. What makes a case study worth reading is that it's a story — tension, a turn, a payoff. Nobody finishes a status report.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "story-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open with a hook.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Drop the reader into the tension — a moment, a number, a question — not a table of contents. The first line decides whether they read the second.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "story-hook-ex",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "emoji": "📌"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hooks you: ",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"The night before our demo, the whole thing crashed.\"   ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Loses you: ",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"This term we built a scheduling app.\"",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "story-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Then take us somewhere.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " What you tried, the moment it broke or the data surprised you, and what you did about it. The struggle is the interesting part — don't skip to the happy ending. And lead with why it matters; nobody cares what you built it with until they care why it exists.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-label",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A few more things that help:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "good-b2",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
